          {
            "title": "Question: Variables",
            "id": 105029,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang kita gunakan untuk menggabungkan variabel <code>name</code> dengan string literal?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sintaks <code>${name}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solusi <code>$(name)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sintaks <code>$[name]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sintaks <code>${name}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sapaan menggunakan <code>`Welcome, ${name}!`</code>. Bagian mana yang menyisipkan nilai yang tersimpan dalam <code>name</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>${name}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>$(name)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>$[name]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>${name}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Expressions",
            "id": 105031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bananas = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" oranges = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruits = \" /><text value=\"`Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fruits);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sintaks <code>$()</code> seharusnya memiliki kurung kurawal <code>{}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sintaks <code>$()</code> seharusnya memiliki kurung kurawal <code>[]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sintaks <code>$()</code> seharusnya memiliki kurung kurawal <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Template literal menggunakan <code>$(bananas + oranges)</code>. Apa yang akan disertakan dalam teks yang ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bananas = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" oranges = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruits = \" /><text value=\"`Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fruits);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karakter <code>$(bananas + oranges)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Jumlah <code>30</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Error sintaks JavaScript</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karakter <code>$(bananas + oranges)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 105042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gabungkan string literal <code>soccer</code> di dalam variabel <code>eventName</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game = \" /><text value=\"`soccer`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" eventName = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${game}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" tournament`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(eventName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"soccer tournament\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>$</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, lalu <code>game</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>soccer tournament</code> dengan menyisipkan nilai <code>game</code> ke dalam template literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game = \" /><text value=\"`soccer`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" eventName = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${game}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" tournament`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(eventName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"$(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{game}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"eventName\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"match\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"soccer tournament\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>${</code>, diikuti oleh <code>game</code>, <code>}</code>, dan terakhir <code>tournament</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Expressions",
            "id": 105044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode untuk menampilkan jumlah penggemar di stadion sepak bola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" normalSeats = \" /><text value=\"32100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" vipSeats = \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fans = \" /><text value=\"`Fans : \" /><text value=\"${normalSeats + vipSeats}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fans);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Fans : 32550\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>$</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, lalu <code>+</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan jumlah penggemar, <code>Fans : 32550</code>, dengan mengevaluasi dua jumlah kursi dalam template literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" normalSeats = \" /><text value=\"32100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" vipSeats = \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fans = \" /><text value=\"`Fans : \" /><text value=\"${normalSeats + vipSeats}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fans);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"$(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"normalSeats\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Fans : 32550\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>vipSeats</code>, diikuti oleh <code>${</code>, <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Functions",
            "id": 105035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi <code>getTeam</code> dan teruskan string literal <code>Messi</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTeam = \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team = \" /><text value=\"`PSG`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"'s team is \" /><text value=\"${team}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\".`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getTeam\" /><text value=\"`Messi`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Messi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Messi'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Messi's team is PSG.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>getTeam</code>, diikuti oleh <code>`Messi`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan bentuk pemanggilan backtick langsung tanpa tanda kurung untuk menampilkan <code>Messi's team is PSG.</code>.</p><p>Lengkapi teks yang dikembalikan menggunakan nilai team yang disimpan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTeam = \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team = \" /><text value=\"`PSG`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"'s team is \" /><text value=\"${team}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\".`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getTeam\" /><text value=\"`Messi`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTeam(&quot;Messi&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Messi&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Messi's team is PSG.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>team</code>, diikuti oleh <code>getTeam</code>, dan terakhir <code>`Messi`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Basic Array Destructuring",
            "id": 121623,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apakah <code>\"Nissan\"</code> adalah salah satu elemen yang di-destructure dari array ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [firstCar, secondCar, thirdCard, fourthCar, fifthCar,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" sixthCar\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Honda&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Volkswagen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bentley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cadillac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chevrolet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nissan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(secondCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(thirdCard);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fourthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fifthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sixthCar);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Honda\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Volkswagen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bentley\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Cadillac\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Toyota\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Chevrolet\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Tidak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menambahkan <code>seventhCar</code> setelah <code>sixthCar</code> dalam pola, lalu mencatatnya. Apa yang ditampilkan log tambahan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [firstCar, secondCar, thirdCard, fourthCar, fifthCar,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" sixthCar\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Honda&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Volkswagen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bentley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cadillac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chevrolet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nissan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(secondCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(thirdCard);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fourthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fifthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sixthCar);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Honda\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Volkswagen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bentley\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Cadillac\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Toyota\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Chevrolet\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">\"Nissan\"</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">\"Chevrolet\"</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">undefined</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih \"Nissan\".</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Default values in Arrays",
            "id": 122162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang akan dicetak oleh <code>console.log(favoriteFruit)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [id, userName, favoriteFruit = \" /><text value=\"'Apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"'0015'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Ben Anderson'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Orange'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(userName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(favoriteFruit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0015\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Ben Anderson\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Orange\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Oranye</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Oranye.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menghapus <code>'Orange'</code> dari array sehingga tersisa dua item. Apa yang sekarang ditampilkan log terakhir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [id, userName, favoriteFruit = \" /><text value=\"'Apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"'0015'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Ben Anderson'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Orange'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(userName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(favoriteFruit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0015\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Ben Anderson\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Orange\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Apple, karena nilai ketiga yang hilang menggunakan default.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Orange, karena nilai ketiga sebelumnya dipertahankan.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">undefined, karena array tidak memiliki nilai ketiga.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Apple, karena nilai ketiga yang hilang menggunakan default.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Assign the Rest in Arrays",
            "id": 121624,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Destrukturkan dua elemen pertama dari array ini, dan simpan elemen lainnya di dalam variabel <code>otherCars</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [firstCar, secondCard, ...otherCars] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Honda&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Volkswagen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bentley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cadillac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chevrolet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nissan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Kia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(secondCard);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(otherCars);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"41\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Honda\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Volkswagen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Bentley', 'Cadillac', 'Toyota', 'Chevrolet', 'Nissan', 'Kia' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>...otherCars</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Basic Object Destructuring",
            "id": 121619,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Destrukturkan object <code>animal</code> dan tambahkan kedua variabel dalam <code>console.log</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" animal = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pet\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'cat'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" pet,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} = animal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Hi friends! I'm a \" /><text value=\"${pet}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" and I am \" /><text value=\"${age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" years old.`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"125\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi friends! I'm a cat and I am 3 years old.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>pet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>age</code>, lalu <code>pet</code>, <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>",
